# Do Not Modify Reference Directories

**Do not create, edit, or delete any files** in external **reference-only** trees (e.g. local clones or checkouts of **ULS_V2.0** or **primereact-master** used only for reading). Those sources must stay unchanged.

- Use them only for **reading/reference** (e.g. to understand behavior, APIs, or patterns).
- All implementation and changes must be done in the **ulx-components** workspace (e.g. `src/components`, demo app, etc.).
- If a task would require changing files under ULS_V2.0 or primereact-master, do not make those changes; implement or document the behavior within the ulx-components codebase instead.
